    24	# Whether anything of an arm is RUNNING is decided from its pid files, and one module
    25	# reads those: tools/exp11_pidrecord.py, which answers `record <pid>` or `norecord` and
    26	# is checked against two known files before every scan and every resolution. Anything
    27	# else it says or does is "unknown", and unknown is not an answer: **a broken reader
    28	# closes the arm to every automated decision; it never opens it** (close review 11).
