   837	    # holds: a full-mode launcher holds the publication lock for its child's whole run,
   838	    # so a trainer could never take that one. This one is held only across a
   839	    # registration and across this resolution -- exactly the pair that must not
   840	    # interleave, because the trainer's checks and its write straddle the rename below
