   883	            "unresolved launch, retired under this arm's publication and registration locks: a launching marker older than ${UNRESOLVED_GRACE_S}s, no recorded pid of this arm alive, no completion receipt, and not the published final. A trainer that never registered cannot be seen at all; this tombstone is what refuses it." \
